    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AnimaCircus, the player gets into a circus troupe made out exclusively by cats, performing to a human audience excited to see your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the keyboard keys or controller buttons, press the direction shown on-screen at the right time to guarantee the best show possible. But don\u2019t worry if you get it wrong, the spectators are very comprehensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 20 songs composed especially for this show and pick the difficulty that better suits you;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the set come to life as you get many notes consecutively;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar, picking their skin and eyes color, as well your best clothes.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dearest public, welcome to the feline circus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In AnimaCircus, the player gets into a circus troupe made out exclusively by cats, performing to a human audience excited to see your tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using the keyboard keys or controller buttons, press the direction shown on-screen at the right time to guarantee the best show possible. But don\u2019t worry if you get it wrong, the spectators are very comprehensive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 20 songs composed especially for this show and pick the difficulty that better suits you;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the set come to life as you get many notes consecutively;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your avatar, picking their skin and eyes color, as well your best clothes.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Join the troupe of an circus exclusively for cats. Pick your visuals and show your talent as a feline artist.",
